{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Issue 5617: Frigid Fusion survives damage, stores its caster's damage and releases it as Frost damage",
  "contract": [
    "Frigid Blast 500118 (effect 1 SPELL_EFFECT_TRIGGER_SPELL 803225) applies Frigid Fusion 803225: 'Accumulate",
    "$?s707654[30%][20%] of your damage dealt to the target over $d. After the duration, deal it as Frost Damage to",
    "the target.' Duration index 32 (6 s). Effect 0 is a dummy aura naming 572338, the release (SCHOOL_DAMAGE, Frost,",
    "CANT_CRIT, IGNORE_DAMAGE_TAKEN_MODIFIERS, IGNORE_CASTER_DAMAGE_MODIFIERS). Effect 1 carries MiscValueB 20 on aura",
    "69 SPELL_AURA_SCHOOL_ABSORB with BasePoints 0 and DieSides 1, which natively gives the enemy a 1-point absorb",
    "that the first hit consumes and removes (AURA_REMOVE_BY_ENEMY_SPELL): the reported vanishing debuff; nothing is",
    "stored",
    "or released. Frigid Elements 707654 effect 2 is a dummy of 10 ('accumulates $s3% more damage', 30% in the aura",
    "text); its effects 0 and 1 are native spellmods on Frigid Blast's family mask (cast time +1000 ms, SPELLMOD 24",
    "+50%). Expected: the debuff stays through its caster's and another player's damage; when it expires, its",
    "caster's damage to the target while it lasted is released once as 572338 at 20%, or 30% with Frigid Elements;",
    "another player's damage is not stored. Frigid Blast's own hit lands after its triggered debuff; whether that hit",
    "is stored is not established, so the release is bounded by the melee-only and the melee-plus-blast damage."
  ],
  "timeout_ms": 150000,
